|notes=The June 2022 Holotable remaster uses a higher-resolution face and changes the margin mark from E to E1. Its game text is the December 2019 text. The July 2022 repository file encodes the same pixels as PNG.<ref name="f11d-dec">Players Committee, [https://www.starwarsccg.org/competitive-balance-set-12-preview-cards-released/ Competitive Balance, Set 12 Preview Cards Released], 9 December 2019.</ref><ref name="f11d-2022-june">Players Committee, [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/e8445f08fa931119eec2c3f95d5cea095145da26/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual4-Dark/large/f11dblasterrifle.gif Holotable F-11D Blaster Rifle image], 1 June 2022 repository revision.</ref><ref name="f11d-2022-july">Players Committee, [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/a41bae9a74e1300c2325f6f584bab72b56ff28fe/Images-HT/starwars/Virtual4-Dark/large/f11dblasterrifle.gif Holotable F-11D Blaster Rifle image], 6 July 2022 repository revision.</ref> See the [[F-11D Blaster Rifle (Errata)#Errata|game-text comparison]].
